@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title 01. A2A Supervisor Agent System Context

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor User

rectangle "Client Channel" {
  [Web UI / API Client] as Client
}

rectangle "Supervisor Agent (spring-ai + springsupervisorai)" {
  [SupervisorA2AController] as SupervisorA2AController
  [SupervisorAgentService] as SupervisorService
  [SupervisorAgentOrchestrator] as SupervisorOrchestrator
  [LangGraph4J CompiledGraph] as StateGraph
  [HITL Policy/Decision Service] as HitlService
  [SupervisorPlanningService] as Planner
  [A2AInvocationService] as A2AInvocationService
  [SupervisorResponseComposeService] as Composer
  [DefaultSupervisorLlmRuntime] as LlmRuntime
  [A2AClientRegistry] as A2ARegistry
  [GlobalExceptionHandler] as Advice
}

database "Redis" as Redis {
  [Conversation Store] as ConversationStore
  [Graph Checkpoint Store] as CheckpointStore
  [Swarm State Store] as SwarmStateStore
}

cloud "Downstream A2A Agents" {
  [Product Agent A2A] as ProductAgent
  [Reservation Agent A2A] as ReservationAgent
  [Search Agent A2A] as SearchAgent
}

artifact "a2a-supervisor.yml" as HostYml

User --> Client
Client --> SupervisorA2AController : /a2a/supervisor
SupervisorA2AController --> SupervisorService
SupervisorA2AController --> Advice
SupervisorService --> SupervisorOrchestrator
SupervisorOrchestrator --> StateGraph
SupervisorOrchestrator --> HitlService
SupervisorOrchestrator --> Planner
SupervisorOrchestrator --> A2AInvocationService
SupervisorOrchestrator --> Composer
Planner --> LlmRuntime
Composer --> LlmRuntime
A2AInvocationService --> A2ARegistry
A2ARegistry --> HostYml
A2AInvocationService --> ProductAgent
A2AInvocationService --> ReservationAgent
A2AInvocationService --> SearchAgent
SupervisorOrchestrator --> ConversationStore
SupervisorOrchestrator --> CheckpointStore
SupervisorOrchestrator --> SwarmStateStore

note right of SupervisorOrchestrator
Supervisor flow
- intent planning
- downstream agent selection
- A2A call (sync/stream)
- result compose
- history/checkpoint persist
end note

' 2026-04-12 sync with docs 30/31
' - Scope: HITL decision limited to APPROVE/CANCEL in current phase
' - Data mutation requests (create/update/delete) require mandatory HITL
' - A2A compatibility mode keeps both legacy and v1.0 methods
' - User profile input collection is deferred to next phase
@enduml
